  "question": {
    "text": "For a singular matrix <math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and the matrix&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to",
