  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>22</mn></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></math> (given)<br />i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>22</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p>",
